(4774430, 689795, 72929, '<td valign="top">Love the PP/yellowed look and burned edges. The expressions and pose are interesting in some way that I can''t put my finger on.</td>', 'Love the PP/yellowed look and burned edges. The expressions and pose are interesting in some way that I can''t put my finger on.', '2008-06-18 10:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
