(4774436, 689715, 72929, '<td valign="top">Some would argue her hand on his shoulder is a distraction due to it being visually detached, i.e. you can''t see her arm. His arm draped over her takes over the shot a bit. But choice of background and shirt colors guarantees via color contrasts that your eyes are drawn to theirs due to their dark hair.</td>', 'Some would argue her hand on his shoulder is a distraction due to it being visually detached, i.e. you can''t see her arm. His arm draped over her takes over the shot a bit. But choice of background and shirt colors guarantees via color contrasts that your eyes are drawn to theirs due to their dark hair.', '2008-06-18 10:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4774438, 689636, 72929, '<td valign="top">Would''ve been a 10 if they were looking at the camera and/or they were a bit sharper. Good use of thirds and luminance contrast to make their faces the only bright point in the picture.. draws your eyes immediately to them.</td>', 'Would''ve been a 10 if they were looking at the camera and/or they were a bit sharper. Good use of thirds and luminance contrast to make their faces the only bright point in the picture.. draws your eyes immediately to them.', '2008-06-18 10:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
