(4774613, 688533, 27514, '<td valign="top">Wow,  this is really a Gem in this challenge. Great Framing, Great use of props. <br/> <br/>The lighting of the floor is a little dirty, but who doesn''t fix that in photoshop when they aren''t under the strain of the silly basic editing rules<br/> <br/> <br/>great job....I could call this a strong nine, but I think im going to give it a 10 because how far it shines above most</td>', 'Wow,  this is really a Gem in this challenge. Great Framing, Great use of props.  The lighting of the floor is a little dirty, but who doesn''t fix that in photoshop when they aren''t under the strain of the silly basic editing rules  great job....I could call this a strong nine, but I think im going to give it a 10 because how far it shines above most', '2008-06-18 12:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
