(4774788, 689797, 91282, '<td valign="top">This is such a cute picture! You captured a great moment. Would''ve liked it a tad sharper and maybe cropped a little tighter around the couple, but all in all, this is a great photo. I''m sure they will cherish it for many years to come. :)</td>', 'This is such a cute picture! You captured a great moment. Would''ve liked it a tad sharper and maybe cropped a little tighter around the couple, but all in all, this is a great photo. I''m sure they will cherish it for many years to come. :)', '2008-06-18 14:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4774852, 689784, 20577, '<td valign="top">Your camera has already paid for itself in the number of great pictures you have gotten of these two. I think this is the best of the ones I have seen so far. This truly has a chance at a ribbon... it would have a better chance if only the photographer wasn''t so ugly, but you can only ask for so much...</td>', 'Your camera has already paid for itself in the number of great pictures you have gotten of these two. I think this is the best of the ones I have seen so far. This truly has a chance at a ribbon... it would have a better chance if only the photographer wasn''t so ugly, but you can only ask for so much...', '2008-06-18 14:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
