(4775025, 689440, 62357, '<td valign="top">Is this <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=60862" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">levyj413</a>?  It''s beautiful and I hope you have it printed and hanging at home.</td>', 'Is this  levyj413?  It''s beautiful and I hope you have it printed and hanging at home.', '2008-06-18 16:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
