(4775164, 689457, 76598, '<td valign="top">The light and the sharpening strike me as too harsh</td>', 'The light and the sharpening strike me as too harsh', '2008-06-18 18:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775166, 688039, 76598, '<td valign="top">The light across the baby''s face is really distracting, poor lighting conditions</td>', 'The light across the baby''s face is really distracting, poor lighting conditions', '2008-06-18 18:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775167, 688679, 76598, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the tone of the image, the background is distracting to me, perhaps a shallower depth of field or further from the background would have helped.</td>', 'I like the colors and the tone of the image, the background is distracting to me, perhaps a shallower depth of field or further from the background would have helped.', '2008-06-18 18:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775169, 689630, 76598, '<td valign="top">very nice, wholesome</td>', 'very nice, wholesome', '2008-06-18 18:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775174, 689694, 76598, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and the color contrast,</td>', 'I like the angle and the color contrast,', '2008-06-18 18:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775175, 689699, 76598, '<td valign="top">focus appears a little soft</td>', 'focus appears a little soft', '2008-06-18 18:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775179, 689805, 76598, '<td valign="top">Absolutely great setup, excellent title, I like the image, but the lighting is uneven and not pleasing to me eye.</td>', 'Absolutely great setup, excellent title, I like the image, but the lighting is uneven and not pleasing to me eye.', '2008-06-18 18:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775186, 689636, 58691, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition. The vertical orientation of the lovely models is rather unique and the lighting, while subtle, provides great emotion. The transition from model to drapery pattern to an abyss draws the eye across the image as it draw the mind down the path of "what/who are they waiting on... and why. Yet, the contentment in their expression implies both patience and anticipation.</td>', 'Wonderful composition. The vertical orientation of the lovely models is rather unique and the lighting, while subtle, provides great emotion. The transition from model to drapery pattern to an abyss draws the eye across the image as it draw the mind down the path of "what/who are they waiting on... and why. Yet, the contentment in their expression implies both patience and anticipation.', '2008-06-18 18:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775187, 689534, 58691, '<td valign="top">The processing on this gives it a creepy/eerie/spooky feel in contrast to their wonderful smiles. Contrast, depth and lighting are well executed and make this an image that really grabs the viewer''s attention and captivates... at least it did to me.</td>', 'The processing on this gives it a creepy/eerie/spooky feel in contrast to their wonderful smiles. Contrast, depth and lighting are well executed and make this an image that really grabs the viewer''s attention and captivates... at least it did to me.', '2008-06-18 18:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775199, 689637, 14867, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the place where the horizon crosses their head/<br/>All the rest is good, above all the contrast blonde/brown, the foreground and the tones</td>', 'Not sure I like the place where the horizon crosses their head/All the rest is good, above all the contrast blonde/brown, the foreground and the tones', '2008-06-18 18:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775200, 688295, 58691, '<td valign="top">The dichotomy of body paint and body art as well as colored hair and baldness is an excellent study of contradictions. The shadowing/darkness at top left hinders the over all image slightly, but that same natural lighting is perfect for the rest of the male subject''s face. Interesting and fun image.</td>', 'The dichotomy of body paint and body art as well as colored hair and baldness is an excellent study of contradictions. The shadowing/darkness at top left hinders the over all image slightly, but that same natural lighting is perfect for the rest of the male subject''s face. Interesting and fun image.', '2008-06-18 18:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775201, 688797, 9462, '<td valign="top">Adorable! It looks as if he''s casting light down onto that fella on the bench, like he''s an angel or something. This is more of a snapshot than a portrait.</td>', 'Adorable! It looks as if he''s casting light down onto that fella on the bench, like he''s an angel or something. This is more of a snapshot than a portrait.', '2008-06-18 18:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775211, 689071, 93756, '<td valign="top">Terrific but I would have cropped out more of the distractions in the background. Also could have centered it better.</td>', 'Terrific but I would have cropped out more of the distractions in the background. Also could have centered it better.', '2008-06-18 18:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775217, 688874, 58691, '<td valign="top">The is beautiful emotion in this capture. The fact that you cannot fully make out the expression of the person in the foreground, and that streak of blood/scar alludes to some painful experience. In contrast, his companion, fixated on what ever he has in his hand (brilliantly obscured), looks almost content if not smiling. Shallow DOF was a choice to isolate them and focus and exposure are perfect - as evident by the burning ember and the ball in the earring, not to mention the wrinkles in the neck and the pattern in the hat.</td>', 'The is beautiful emotion in this capture. The fact that you cannot fully make out the expression of the person in the foreground, and that streak of blood/scar alludes to some painful experience. In contrast, his companion, fixated on what ever he has in his hand (brilliantly obscured), looks almost content if not smiling. Shallow DOF was a choice to isolate them and focus and exposure are perfect - as evident by the burning ember and the ball in the earring, not to mention the wrinkles in the neck and the pattern in the hat.', '2008-06-18 18:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775218, 688295, 14867, '<td valign="top">Probably my prefered in this (excellent) challenge: it''s a portrait, but dynamic; it''s an almost classic pose, but so original too. Unexpected and funny.<br/>I like their attitude too: happy, with something a bit sad beyond...human.<br/>Your cropping is just perfect.</td>', 'Probably my prefered in this (excellent) challenge: it''s a portrait, but dynamic; it''s an almost classic pose, but so original too. Unexpected and funny.I like their attitude too: happy, with something a bit sad beyond...human.Your cropping is just perfect.', '2008-06-18 18:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775226, 689303, 14867, '<td valign="top">Great idea, deserves a ribbon for its originality and quality, the only little flaws are the bright white areas (flags?) in the background, distracting enough.</td>', 'Great idea, deserves a ribbon for its originality and quality, the only little flaws are the bright white areas (flags?) in the background, distracting enough.', '2008-06-18 18:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775237, 689738, 89723, '<td valign="top">Stunning!!</td>', 'Stunning!!', '2008-06-18 18:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775238, 688205, 89723, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo. I hope this does well for you. Great looking kids.</td>', 'Amazing photo. I hope this does well for you. Great looking kids.', '2008-06-18 18:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775321, 689787, 58691, '<td valign="top">There is much going on in this seemingly simple image, but they don''t complement each other or come together to form a cohesive impression. Personification of the bear doesn''t really work in the image to meet the challenge description of a 2 Person Portrait. The air mask seems wildly out of place as does the face paint. They both block what otherwise could be a fun smile and hairdo, which would seem to make a good singular portrait. The lighting is good and the perspective from the decorated fingernails and up the arms is interesting. The crop at the bottom loses continuity and seems odd.</td>', 'There is much going on in this seemingly simple image, but they don''t complement each other or come together to form a cohesive impression. Personification of the bear doesn''t really work in the image to meet the challenge description of a 2 Person Portrait. The air mask seems wildly out of place as does the face paint. They both block what otherwise could be a fun smile and hairdo, which would seem to make a good singular portrait. The lighting is good and the perspective from the decorated fingernails and up the arms is interesting. The crop at the bottom loses continuity and seems odd.', '2008-06-18 20:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775354, 688947, 52992, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.</td>', 'This is beautiful.', '2008-06-18 20:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775391, 689737, 90372, '<td valign="top">The composition is good but the cool skin tones detract a little: 6.</td>', 'The composition is good but the cool skin tones detract a little: 6.', '2008-06-18 21:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775431, 688205, 58691, '<td valign="top">Unique and creative composition and crop and they come together very well. The ocular diagonal is slightly offset as though it is really the eyebrows that are in alignment, which stand in strong contrast between the blond and the brunette  and the soft wave of hair vs. the more coarse hair. The glowing smoothness in their skin gives the image a soft-focus feel even though the focus is tack sharp.</td>', 'Unique and creative composition and crop and they come together very well. The ocular diagonal is slightly offset as though it is really the eyebrows that are in alignment, which stand in strong contrast between the blond and the brunette  and the soft wave of hair vs. the more coarse hair. The glowing smoothness in their skin gives the image a soft-focus feel even though the focus is tack sharp.', '2008-06-18 21:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775432, 689558, 58691, '<td valign="top">What jumps out in this image is the slight increase in texture of the skin and the more intense look on the face of the subject on the left. The other looks younger and has a peaceful innocence to him. The mole becomes a point of interest that the viewer can''t help but concentrate on. The lighting is incredible.</td>', 'What jumps out in this image is the slight increase in texture of the skin and the more intense look on the face of the subject on the left. The other looks younger and has a peaceful innocence to him. The mole becomes a point of interest that the viewer can''t help but concentrate on. The lighting is incredible.', '2008-06-18 21:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775433, 688533, 58691, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a feeling that is quite special - that of an older brother concerned with the well-being of his younger sibling - "My Brother''s Keeper". The bunny on the left hangs as secondary to the focus on his brother. The offset positioning and large amount of white space is a portrait composition that I prefer.</td>', 'You''ve captured a feeling that is quite special - that of an older brother concerned with the well-being of his younger sibling - "My Brother''s Keeper". The bunny on the left hangs as secondary to the focus on his brother. The offset positioning and large amount of white space is a portrait composition that I prefer.', '2008-06-18 21:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775435, 688434, 58691, '<td valign="top">Excellent lines and layers in this image. The transition from deep blacks through the black/white/grey plaid to the lightly textured floor and ending with a backdrop of the smooth wall. This would make and excellent print as the small 640 size hides the details in the clothing. There is a wonderful casualness to the capture, yet it doesn''t drop to triteness of a snapshot.</td>', 'Excellent lines and layers in this image. The transition from deep blacks through the black/white/grey plaid to the lightly textured floor and ending with a backdrop of the smooth wall. This would make and excellent print as the small 640 size hides the details in the clothing. There is a wonderful casualness to the capture, yet it doesn''t drop to triteness of a snapshot.', '2008-06-18 21:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775436, 689637, 58691, '<td valign="top">The duotone finish was the perfect choice for this image as was the wide DOF. The straight lines of the the models'' hair, so uniform, stand in wonderful contrast to the chaos in the tines of the wheat. The angry look of the blond takes away slightly from the otherwise emotionless, or, at least contented feeling of the image. The starkness of the sky and the intrusion of the tops of their heads into that spaces adds a very interesting element to the overall image.</td>', 'The duotone finish was the perfect choice for this image as was the wide DOF. The straight lines of the the models'' hair, so uniform, stand in wonderful contrast to the chaos in the tines of the wheat. The angry look of the blond takes away slightly from the otherwise emotionless, or, at least contented feeling of the image. The starkness of the sky and the intrusion of the tops of their heads into that spaces adds a very interesting element to the overall image.', '2008-06-18 21:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775453, 689702, 58691, '<td valign="top">Picture Perfect. Great choice to go with a greyscale image. There is an incredible transition from detail to blur and the angles created by the position of the bodies provide not only visual interest, but stimulation as well. The youthfulness of the male figure exudes an innocence, yet the shapely form of the female is quite seductive, though it has no impression on him.</td>', 'Picture Perfect. Great choice to go with a greyscale image. There is an incredible transition from detail to blur and the angles created by the position of the bodies provide not only visual interest, but stimulation as well. The youthfulness of the male figure exudes an innocence, yet the shapely form of the female is quite seductive, though it has no impression on him.', '2008-06-18 22:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
