(4776283, 689805, 48094, '<td valign="top">Nice tone, but I wish the mother''s face was lit more</td>', 'Nice tone, but I wish the mother''s face was lit more', '2008-06-19 11:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4776287, 689338, 48094, '<td valign="top">Great capture of an emotional moment. I think a tighter crop would make the image stronger.</td>', 'Great capture of an emotional moment. I think a tighter crop would make the image stronger.', '2008-06-19 11:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4776290, 689636, 48094, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful.</td>', 'Very beautiful.', '2008-06-19 12:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4776303, 689709, 83934, '<td valign="top">this picture is a little flat, the focal point should be in the eyes to bring the life out of your subject and there is little chiaroscuro which makes this picture lack depth. Try using a hair light and using a 1 to 2 stop difference between your main and fill.</td>', 'this picture is a little flat, the focal point should be in the eyes to bring the life out of your subject and there is little chiaroscuro which makes this picture lack depth. Try using a hair light and using a 1 to 2 stop difference between your main and fill.', '2008-06-19 12:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4776304, 689780, 83934, '<td valign="top">great idea, the sharpness could be a little better</td>', 'great idea, the sharpness could be a little better', '2008-06-19 12:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4776305, 689795, 83934, '<td valign="top">really enjoy this one. great lighting. Like the fact the subject isnt looking at the camera and the crimson background really shows good reflection on skin and clothing. Without the subject line, would never have guessed it were a lemon.</td>', 'really enjoy this one. great lighting. Like the fact the subject isnt looking at the camera and the crimson background really shows good reflection on skin and clothing. Without the subject line, would never have guessed it were a lemon.', '2008-06-19 12:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4776306, 689558, 83934, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot. very harsh light from one angle but it gives depth and emotion in their eyes. Cool</td>', 'this is a great shot. very harsh light from one angle but it gives depth and emotion in their eyes. Cool', '2008-06-19 12:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4776308, 689715, 83934, '<td valign="top">good shot. nice clarity, focus point and depth of field. with a slight bit of sharpening, both subjects would be sharp. overall great angle and shot</td>', 'good shot. nice clarity, focus point and depth of field. with a slight bit of sharpening, both subjects would be sharp. overall great angle and shot', '2008-06-19 12:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4776309, 689620, 83934, '<td valign="top">This picture rocks. It really speaks the emotion and character of the subjects. great contrast and clarity. This could easily be a pic you would see in a studio or on a wall at someones house. Great job</td>', 'This picture rocks. It really speaks the emotion and character of the subjects. great contrast and clarity. This could easily be a pic you would see in a studio or on a wall at someones house. Great job', '2008-06-19 12:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4776310, 689740, 83934, '<td valign="top">Cool angle and great clarity. Good job</td>', 'Cool angle and great clarity. Good job', '2008-06-19 12:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4776312, 689637, 83934, '<td valign="top">This shot is great. I would like to see what it would look like with a high speed synch or a gold reflector(in color that is)</td>', 'This shot is great. I would like to see what it would look like with a high speed synch or a gold reflector(in color that is)', '2008-06-19 12:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4776314, 689737, 83934, '<td valign="top">good composition, pay attention to your white balance setting on your camera. If it were set to a cloudy day, the skin tones would probably be a little more appealing. good depth of field.</td>', 'good composition, pay attention to your white balance setting on your camera. If it were set to a cloudy day, the skin tones would probably be a little more appealing. good depth of field.', '2008-06-19 12:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4776317, 689215, 83934, '<td valign="top">Thelma and Louise, watch out. great colors and quite funny.</td>', 'Thelma and Louise, watch out. great colors and quite funny.', '2008-06-19 12:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4776320, 689596, 83934, '<td valign="top">Great picture! Pay attention to angles in the ambient light, if you would have caught a little more in their eyes, it would have made this picture alot better</td>', 'Great picture! Pay attention to angles in the ambient light, if you would have caught a little more in their eyes, it would have made this picture alot better', '2008-06-19 12:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4776323, 688357, 83934, '<td valign="top">Cute picture. Pay attention to white balance. Set the camera to cloudy day to bring out a little more color in your subjects.</td>', 'Cute picture. Pay attention to white balance. Set the camera to cloudy day to bring out a little more color in your subjects.', '2008-06-19 12:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4776324, 689303, 83934, '<td valign="top">Very unique picture. I like the black and white and the clarity is great. This could easily be on an advertisement for V8</td>', 'Very unique picture. I like the black and white and the clarity is great. This could easily be on an advertisement for V8', '2008-06-19 12:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4776421, 689440, 53147, '<td valign="top">So I am reading through the score thread and I think I need to be swayed by the discussion (even irrationally so). I am not quite sure if this was a setup shot so I must DNMC it and give it a 2. Odds are these girls did not even realize they were lying next to each other or that someone was standing over them taking their picture. So I would have to lean towards the fact that this is more of a caught candid rather than a planned portrait which obviously does not meet the challenge. In fact so much so that I am going to call this shot up for validation in hopes that they will change the rule about not disqualifying DNMC images. I am just totally amazed that someone would enter an image like this into a challenge of this type. <br/> <br/>ETA - bumping up. ;)</td>', 'So I am reading through the score thread and I think I need to be swayed by the discussion (even irrationally so). I am not quite sure if this was a setup shot so I must DNMC it and give it a 2. Odds are these girls did not even realize they were lying next to each other or that someone was standing over them taking their picture. So I would have to lean towards the fact that this is more of a caught candid rather than a planned portrait which obviously does not meet the challenge. In fact so much so that I am going to call this shot up for validation in hopes that they will change the rule about not disqualifying DNMC images. I am just totally amazed that someone would enter an image like this into a challenge of this type.  ETA - bumping up. ;)', '2008-06-19 13:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
