(4777245, 688205, 54645, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition. I particularly like the conversion and the range of tones. The models are captivating. What I don''t like...the left child does not look as real as the one on the right. Did you use a diffuse glow filter? Maybe too much USM. Anyway, I''m giving this an 8. I''ll pass on commenting on the Too instead of Two, oops, no I won''t!</td>', 'Wonderful composition. I particularly like the conversion and the range of tones. The models are captivating. What I don''t like...the left child does not look as real as the one on the right. Did you use a diffuse glow filter? Maybe too much USM. Anyway, I''m giving this an 8. I''ll pass on commenting on the Too instead of Two, oops, no I won''t!', '2008-06-20 03:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
