(4777510, 688711, 66384, '<td valign="top">This looks to me like the saturation was pumped up too much -- the color gradients around the highlights on both faces and the woman''s arm. I like the composition, and pose. This is a good portrait showing the subjects'' interest in addition to their faces, I just find the processing distracting.</td>', 'This looks to me like the saturation was pumped up too much -- the color gradients around the highlights on both faces and the woman''s arm. I like the composition, and pose. This is a good portrait showing the subjects'' interest in addition to their faces, I just find the processing distracting.', '2008-06-20 11:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4777512, 689790, 66384, '<td valign="top">Whoa, this makes me dizzy, but I like it. I feel like I am spinning with them. Nice clear and flattering shot of both kids.</td>', 'Whoa, this makes me dizzy, but I like it. I feel like I am spinning with them. Nice clear and flattering shot of both kids.', '2008-06-20 11:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4777514, 689338, 93927, '<td valign="top">HAHAHA, she looks drunk. thanks for putting a smile on my face so early in the morning.</td>', 'HAHAHA, she looks drunk. thanks for putting a smile on my face so early in the morning.', '2008-06-20 11:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
