(4777527, 689637, 66384, '<td valign="top">I love the setting and the quality of the image -- the composition, light, and the softness of the  grass and sepia tone. I don''t like the hostile expression on the blond''s face. I think it detracts from the serenity and the tie between the girls. Perhaps it is directed at the intrusion of the photographer or viewer, but I would like to observe this relationship unnoticed. 8</td>', 'I love the setting and the quality of the image -- the composition, light, and the softness of the  grass and sepia tone. I don''t like the hostile expression on the blond''s face. I think it detracts from the serenity and the tie between the girls. Perhaps it is directed at the intrusion of the photographer or viewer, but I would like to observe this relationship unnoticed. 8', '2008-06-20 11:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4777539, 689737, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very strong family resemblance. I like the way you emphasized that with the matching colored clothing. I like the focus and DOF and their pleasant natural expressions. The lighting seems unbalanced on the two subjects -- too harsh on him (blown highlight on forehead) and too shaded on her. Also, I wish you had positioned them is such a way that the mother didn''t have to crouch to get close to the boy. The posture looks unnatural and uncomfortable.</td>', 'Very strong family resemblance. I like the way you emphasized that with the matching colored clothing. I like the focus and DOF and their pleasant natural expressions. The lighting seems unbalanced on the two subjects -- too harsh on him (blown highlight on forehead) and too shaded on her. Also, I wish you had positioned them is such a way that the mother didn''t have to crouch to get close to the boy. The posture looks unnatural and uncomfortable.', '2008-06-20 11:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4777550, 689457, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the pose, but I find the harsh processing (over-sharpening?) unattractive. Also their make up is distracting -- mother''s worn off lipstick, daughter''s harsh streak of blush and the gloppy mascara.</td>', 'I like the pose, but I find the harsh processing (over-sharpening?) unattractive. Also their make up is distracting -- mother''s worn off lipstick, daughter''s harsh streak of blush and the gloppy mascara.', '2008-06-20 11:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4777559, 689440, 66384, '<td valign="top">Well, there are those beautiful girls we have come to know and love! this is really nice. I like the lighting and focus, and the expressions are showing us quite a bit about their personalities.</td>', 'Well, there are those beautiful girls we have come to know and love! this is really nice. I like the lighting and focus, and the expressions are showing us quite a bit about their personalities.', '2008-06-20 11:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4777563, 689542, 66384, '<td valign="top">You really did capture joy in both the subjects of this shot. Great family keepsake.</td>', 'You really did capture joy in both the subjects of this shot. Great family keepsake.', '2008-06-20 11:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
