(4778770, 689738, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this- it looks like the expressions are true and not created just for the shot. I really like the soft lighting, great composition. Received my highest vote in the challenge.</td>', 'I like everything about this- it looks like the expressions are true and not created just for the shot. I really like the soft lighting, great composition. Received my highest vote in the challenge.', '2008-06-21 01:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
