(4778914, 689801, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s not screaming ''Portrait'' to me however, I do like it and it''s the only ''in color'' photo that I gave a 10 too. I think your photo should be in the top 10. I really like all the subtle blues. They really seem to have a lot of contrast with each other.</td>', 'It''s not screaming ''Portrait'' to me however, I do like it and it''s the only ''in color'' photo that I gave a 10 too. I think your photo should be in the top 10. I really like all the subtle blues. They really seem to have a lot of contrast with each other.', '2008-06-21 06:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4778917, 689637, 62187, '<td valign="top">Almost too far away for what I think of as ''Portrait''. But, it''s certainly one of the better photos of the challenge - the light sepia work well with the grass and attractive faces never hurt anybody. I think your photo will certainly end up in the top 10. It was only 1 of 5 tens I gave out this challenge.</td>', 'Almost too far away for what I think of as ''Portrait''. But, it''s certainly one of the better photos of the challenge - the light sepia work well with the grass and attractive faces never hurt anybody. I think your photo will certainly end up in the top 10. It was only 1 of 5 tens I gave out this challenge.', '2008-06-21 06:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4778918, 689596, 62187, '<td valign="top">An excellent photo, right on the money for the challenge. It''s a 10 and I''m sure it will end up if not with the Blue then in the top 10 for sure.</td>', 'An excellent photo, right on the money for the challenge. It''s a 10 and I''m sure it will end up if not with the Blue then in the top 10 for sure.', '2008-06-21 06:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
