(4779300, 688205, 67258, '<td valign="top">Well, I recognise these two, and from the style of processing I would guess Timfy.  I love the composition (although it would be really cool if they both had the same white t-shirts on), and the very serene, quiet expressions on the children''s faces, but if I am honest I am not keen on the processing - to me it adds an air of falseness, of artificiality to the photo.</td>', 'Well, I recognise these two, and from the style of processing I would guess Timfy.  I love the composition (although it would be really cool if they both had the same white t-shirts on), and the very serene, quiet expressions on the children''s faces, but if I am honest I am not keen on the processing - to me it adds an air of falseness, of artificiality to the photo.', '2008-06-21 15:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
