(4780146, 689338, 42740, '<td valign="top">Too bad the girl with the drink has her hand there.  It makes the one who''s crying look like she''s a little bit drunk.  I might have cropped out the plaid shirt on the left, also. Still, you grab a shot when you can.</td>', 'Too bad the girl with the drink has her hand there.  It makes the one who''s crying look like she''s a little bit drunk.  I might have cropped out the plaid shirt on the left, also. Still, you grab a shot when you can.', '2008-06-22 15:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
