(4780240, 689637, 8624, '<td valign="top">love the tones and the poses. the girls'' hair looks as silky as the wheat in the fields. one of my top picks.</td>', 'love the tones and the poses. the girls'' hair looks as silky as the wheat in the fields. one of my top picks.', '2008-06-22 17:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4780243, 689762, 8624, '<td valign="top">adorable. the expressions of both girls is wonderful and the colors really pop. one of my top 2 picks.</td>', 'adorable. the expressions of both girls is wonderful and the colors really pop. one of my top 2 picks.', '2008-06-22 17:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4780244, 689641, 8624, '<td valign="top">very sultry. I like it in black and white but I wonder how nice the silk robes would have looked in color.</td>', 'very sultry. I like it in black and white but I wonder how nice the silk robes would have looked in color.', '2008-06-22 17:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4780245, 689702, 8624, '<td valign="top">terrific pose well executed. I like the lighting and the reflections in the water</td>', 'terrific pose well executed. I like the lighting and the reflections in the water', '2008-06-22 17:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4780247, 689114, 8624, '<td valign="top">I love the interaction between the two as they are both reaching for the same object. great tension in the shot as you don''t know what the reaction will be from the one who got it and the one who didn''t. :)</td>', 'I love the interaction between the two as they are both reaching for the same object. great tension in the shot as you don''t know what the reaction will be from the one who got it and the one who didn''t. :)', '2008-06-22 17:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4780249, 689215, 8624, '<td valign="top">really fun portrait! these two ladies look like they are having a blast. I like the color pink splash from the boas</td>', 'really fun portrait! these two ladies look like they are having a blast. I like the color pink splash from the boas', '2008-06-22 17:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4780251, 689718, 8624, '<td valign="top">where is the other person?</td>', 'where is the other person?', '2008-06-22 17:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4780252, 689695, 8624, '<td valign="top">this a pretty losse interpretation of a 2 person portrait, but I''ll give you credit for creative thinking. the image, however, doesn''t really communicate your title to me. The model is occluding her face with the eye liner pencil. The closed eye and the covered face hides any emotional expression. The "real" person not in the mirror is cropped severely and all I see is a blown out neck and back of ear and swatch of hair.</td>', 'this a pretty losse interpretation of a 2 person portrait, but I''ll give you credit for creative thinking. the image, however, doesn''t really communicate your title to me. The model is occluding her face with the eye liner pencil. The closed eye and the covered face hides any emotional expression. The "real" person not in the mirror is cropped severely and all I see is a blown out neck and back of ear and swatch of hair.', '2008-06-22 17:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4780254, 689802, 8624, '<td valign="top">I generally don''t like to say DNMC but what about this picture says "2 person portrait?" Even if it did, the image of the two bottles is not composed in a very interesting manner and the background is just unattractive.</td>', 'I generally don''t like to say DNMC but what about this picture says "2 person portrait?" Even if it did, the image of the two bottles is not composed in a very interesting manner and the background is just unattractive.', '2008-06-22 17:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4780435, 688389, 16739, '<td valign="top">Nice , would have done better if she were looking at camera</td>', 'Nice , would have done better if she were looking at camera', '2008-06-22 21:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4780442, 688874, 10818, '<td valign="top">Don''t ya just love old hippies?<br/>Great candid, interesting shot.</td>', 'Don''t ya just love old hippies?Great candid, interesting shot.', '2008-06-22 21:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4780445, 689641, 10818, '<td valign="top">That is just amazing.  Beautiful girls, a great pose and super eye contact.<br/>I would imagine the color version was also quite pretty, the robes look quite ornate.</td>', 'That is just amazing.  Beautiful girls, a great pose and super eye contact.I would imagine the color version was also quite pretty, the robes look quite ornate.', '2008-06-22 21:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4780655, 688947, 89774, '<td valign="top">Love the focus</td>', 'Love the focus', '2008-06-23 00:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
