(4783565, 688205, 79806, '<td valign="top">Great lighting - B &amp; W contrast</td>', 'Great lighting - B & W contrast', '2008-06-24 17:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783592, 688999, 93765, '<td valign="top">The crop is rather unconventional, to the point of no longer working. I could accept the top of his head gone, but cutting her face was unfortunate. A Freudian thing...?</td>', 'The crop is rather unconventional, to the point of no longer working. I could accept the top of his head gone, but cutting her face was unfortunate. A Freudian thing...?', '2008-06-24 18:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783594, 689722, 83416, '<td valign="top">Like your idea!</td>', 'Like your idea!', '2008-06-24 18:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783599, 689755, 83416, '<td valign="top">Reflects the relationship as challenge description requires - but a bit too grainy for my taste!</td>', 'Reflects the relationship as challenge description requires - but a bit too grainy for my taste!', '2008-06-24 18:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783600, 689216, 83416, '<td valign="top">Id say its more an action shot (a good one) than a portrait  guessing I am not the only one coming up with such a comment.</td>', 'Id say its more an action shot (a good one) than a portrait  guessing I am not the only one coming up with such a comment.', '2008-06-24 18:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783601, 689302, 93765, '<td valign="top">Lots of interesting action and details, but not quite what I would expect from a portrait.</td>', 'Lots of interesting action and details, but not quite what I would expect from a portrait.', '2008-06-24 18:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783608, 689641, 93765, '<td valign="top">This would have been a very nice image, but for the highlighting of the noses. I find my attention drawn to them, unable to properly appreciate the rest...</td>', 'This would have been a very nice image, but for the highlighting of the noses. I find my attention drawn to them, unable to properly appreciate the rest...', '2008-06-24 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783614, 689636, 83416, '<td valign="top">While the actual relationship between the two women is not evident  the picture creates a certain mood which forces the viewer to wonder about their stories and how they may have intervened. Perfect! Wish you luck!</td>', 'While the actual relationship between the two women is not evident  the picture creates a certain mood which forces the viewer to wonder about their stories and how they may have intervened. Perfect! Wish you luck!', '2008-06-24 18:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783615, 689805, 83416, '<td valign="top">Very well done! Not a lot more I can add. Good luck!</td>', 'Very well done! Not a lot more I can add. Good luck!', '2008-06-24 18:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783618, 689262, 93765, '<td valign="top">Inspiring, I find myself interpreting what''s going on, thanks to the gesture and expressions. I think a step or two to the left would have been beneficial, both to reduce the impact of the collar on the right guy, and to improve focus on the left one.</td>', 'Inspiring, I find myself interpreting what''s going on, thanks to the gesture and expressions. I think a step or two to the left would have been beneficial, both to reduce the impact of the collar on the right guy, and to improve focus on the left one.', '2008-06-24 18:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783626, 689710, 93765, '<td valign="top">Good idea, adequate technical execution. Myself''s intense stare has the feel of intentionally ignoring Me, though. I think it could have been a nice, unexpected twist, if Myself had been watching Me instead...</td>', 'Good idea, adequate technical execution. Myself''s intense stare has the feel of intentionally ignoring Me, though. I think it could have been a nice, unexpected twist, if Myself had been watching Me instead...', '2008-06-24 18:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783628, 689509, 93765, '<td valign="top">Assuming this is candid, I love the attitude of the guys! As a portrait - well...</td>', 'Assuming this is candid, I love the attitude of the guys! As a portrait - well...', '2008-06-24 18:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783636, 689637, 93765, '<td valign="top">Yes! I wouldn''t want to change a thing. The colour scheme is stunning. My choice for blue.</td>', 'Yes! I wouldn''t want to change a thing. The colour scheme is stunning. My choice for blue.', '2008-06-24 18:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783646, 689805, 93765, '<td valign="top">A very, very nice shot! A bit more light on Mother''s face, perhaps. Comp, BG, focus - OK. But those expressions are priceless! Bet you are having fun together...</td>', 'A very, very nice shot! A bit more light on Mother''s face, perhaps. Comp, BG, focus - OK. But those expressions are priceless! Bet you are having fun together...', '2008-06-24 18:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783658, 689641, 61010, '<td valign="top">mind the shadows on their faces. a nice photo.</td>', 'mind the shadows on their faces. a nice photo.', '2008-06-24 19:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783662, 689443, 61010, '<td valign="top">IMO the light on the kid''s face spoils a great photo. nice POV!</td>', 'IMO the light on the kid''s face spoils a great photo. nice POV!', '2008-06-24 19:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783671, 689805, 61010, '<td valign="top">very nice photograph. consider lighting both subjects'' faces, especially the one you point the camera towards.</td>', 'very nice photograph. consider lighting both subjects'' faces, especially the one you point the camera towards.', '2008-06-24 19:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783673, 689762, 61010, '<td valign="top">charming.</td>', 'charming.', '2008-06-24 19:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783674, 688947, 93765, '<td valign="top">A good thing - and please go on with it as long as you can. The little one will benefit no end! <br/>As a portrait, though, let alone of two, this doesn''t really work. Although I could understand if you were hesitant to bring the mother more into it, and to focus in on the action, that would have been necessary to make it a portrait of two. With a suitable angle and/or lighting you could have maintained sufficient anonymity and decency, while elevating the level of interest beyond that of the devoted father alone.</td>', 'A good thing - and please go on with it as long as you can. The little one will benefit no end! As a portrait, though, let alone of two, this doesn''t really work. Although I could understand if you were hesitant to bring the mother more into it, and to focus in on the action, that would have been necessary to make it a portrait of two. With a suitable angle and/or lighting you could have maintained sufficient anonymity and decency, while elevating the level of interest beyond that of the devoted father alone.', '2008-06-24 19:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783676, 688533, 61010, '<td valign="top">nicely done</td>', 'nicely done', '2008-06-24 19:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783680, 689302, 61010, '<td valign="top">IMO you need to decide wether you want things to get in the frame or not, like the man on the right (I assume from your title that you wanted him in the frame). maybe this should have taken for the ''indecisive'' challenge. kidding.</td>', 'IMO you need to decide wether you want things to get in the frame or not, like the man on the right (I assume from your title that you wanted him in the frame). maybe this should have taken for the ''indecisive'' challenge. kidding.', '2008-06-24 19:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
