(4784050, 688295, 56275, '<td valign="top">Didn''t grab me at first, but the more I look at it, the more interesting it becomes. The girl is very interesting &amp; unique (obviously), and I like the contrast with the man. I also like the tilt of her head. It''s playful, and draws you to her eyes.</td>', 'Didn''t grab me at first, but the more I look at it, the more interesting it becomes. The girl is very interesting & unique (obviously), and I like the contrast with the man. I also like the tilt of her head. It''s playful, and draws you to her eyes.', '2008-06-24 23:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
