(4784264, 689639, 19708, '<td valign="top">The harsh post-processing on my initial look kinda'' rubbed me the wrong way, but after letting the mood flow out of the shot, find it to work for, not against the image. Only suggestion I have would be to crop in a bit closer so the cords &amp; such above don''t compete as a focal point.</td>', 'The harsh post-processing on my initial look kinda'' rubbed me the wrong way, but after letting the mood flow out of the shot, find it to work for, not against the image. Only suggestion I have would be to crop in a bit closer so the cords & such above don''t compete as a focal point.', '2008-06-25 00:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
