(4784267, 689737, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, perhaps a bit tighter of a crop and a bit brighter with a touch more contrast would make a big difference. Even something as simple as Image, Auto Contrast (or Auto Color), then edit, fade back about 50%. A lot more could be done here regarding adjusting the skin tones &amp; levels.</td>', 'Nice shot, perhaps a bit tighter of a crop and a bit brighter with a touch more contrast would make a big difference. Even something as simple as Image, Auto Contrast (or Auto Color), then edit, fade back about 50%. A lot more could be done here regarding adjusting the skin tones & levels.', '2008-06-25 00:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
