(4784821, 689762, 67152, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the new PB and top 10.  The expressions here are priceless and the warmth of the tones is outstanding.  Great job!</td>', 'Congrats on the new PB and top 10.  The expressions here are priceless and the warmth of the tones is outstanding.  Great job!', '2008-06-25 07:15:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4784822, 689805, 67152, '<td valign="top">I really like so much about this image - the facial expressions, the theme, the two beautiful young ladies.  I think the only little thing I would say is that the lighting on mom''s face, especially in the eyes, could have used a bit of boost to really take this up a notch.<br/> <br/>Overall, great work and congrats on the awesome score.</td>', 'I really like so much about this image - the facial expressions, the theme, the two beautiful young ladies.  I think the only little thing I would say is that the lighting on mom''s face, especially in the eyes, could have used a bit of boost to really take this up a notch. Overall, great work and congrats on the awesome score.', '2008-06-25 07:17:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4784824, 689784, 67152, '<td valign="top">What a fun image - I really like the brightness of the colors, the joy in the faces and the focus of light - really well done!</td>', 'What a fun image - I really like the brightness of the colors, the joy in the faces and the focus of light - really well done!', '2008-06-25 07:18:42.000000', NULL, 0),
