(4785066, 688856, 37684, '<td valign="top">Interesting results.<br/> <br/>I don''t like the brick in the background, the grout is way to bright.  That comes from sunlight behind them, had it been other than a basic editing, I''d have darkend that up a good bit.  As for his face, well.... you don''t often see it in life either, that''s who he is.<br/> <br/>I figured this for a lowish 5, though not in the 4s.  Oh well.  On with the year.</td>', 'Interesting results. I don''t like the brick in the background, the grout is way to bright.  That comes from sunlight behind them, had it been other than a basic editing, I''d have darkend that up a good bit.  As for his face, well.... you don''t often see it in life either, that''s who he is. I figured this for a lowish 5, though not in the 4s.  Oh well.  On with the year.', '2008-06-25 10:24:36.000000', NULL, 0),
