(4786699, 689702, 33535, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by asij:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats man....  Really nice take.  Just saw that this is your second ribbon. Way to go Dude!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>hey my icelandic friend, thanks a lot. glad to see you still peaking around dpc at least once in a while!</td>', 'Originally posted by asij: Congrats man....  Really nice take.  Just saw that this is your second ribbon. Way to go Dude!!   hey my icelandic friend, thanks a lot. glad to see you still peaking around dpc at least once in a while!', '2008-06-26 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4786700, 689748, 15291, '<td valign="top">Hi Ryan,<br/>       Nice image, the composition is nicely done &amp; the image pops. The utility lighting worked out really well here. The mask &amp; tattoo colors are vivid and crisp. The dog is to cute and I think brings the image together. Overall this is a very nice image it is clean, crisp &amp; sharp. I think you got hammered by a few people (2 person port) but lots of people think of there dogs as family and I would''nt have been as harsh in my scoreing.</td>', 'Hi Ryan,       Nice image, the composition is nicely done & the image pops. The utility lighting worked out really well here. The mask & tattoo colors are vivid and crisp. The dog is to cute and I think brings the image together. Overall this is a very nice image it is clean, crisp & sharp. I think you got hammered by a few people (2 person port) but lots of people think of there dogs as family and I would''nt have been as harsh in my scoreing.', '2008-06-26 11:33:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4786713, 689542, 15291, '<td valign="top">Hi Gipo,<br/>       Wonderful capture. The smile on the child really makes this image. The compositon itself is nicely done but i think a little less dof would have better imho. I also see a slight color cast (yellow) that seems to have thrown off the overall tonality of the image. Other then those two things this is a wonderful image.</td>', 'Hi Gipo,       Wonderful capture. The smile on the child really makes this image. The compositon itself is nicely done but i think a little less dof would have better imho. I also see a slight color cast (yellow) that seems to have thrown off the overall tonality of the image. Other then those two things this is a wonderful image.', '2008-06-26 11:47:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4786716, 689702, 80058, '<td valign="top">Oh wowwwwwwwwwww, just got back from a week away and what a surprise to find you with ANOTHER RIBBON! Top 1 as well! Congrats! =]</td>', 'Oh wowwwwwwwwwww, just got back from a week away and what a surprise to find you with ANOTHER RIBBON! Top 1 as well! Congrats! =]', '2008-06-26 11:55:16.000000', NULL, 0),
