(4789131, 689509, 15291, '<td valign="top">Hi Adam,<br/>       I think this is one of those images you either like or don''t theres no in between. I like it, the composition is well done gives us an overall feel for the situation. The colors are vivid and the image is clean and sharp. The rear view is a nice touch, simple yet creative. I read some of the comments and I would disagree on the crop. I think any cropping here would have done more harm then good. The only thing i see with this image is the reflection of light of off the car it was a bit of a distraction kept drawing my eye.</td>', 'Hi Adam,       I think this is one of those images you either like or don''t theres no in between. I like it, the composition is well done gives us an overall feel for the situation. The colors are vivid and the image is clean and sharp. The rear view is a nice touch, simple yet creative. I read some of the comments and I would disagree on the crop. I think any cropping here would have done more harm then good. The only thing i see with this image is the reflection of light of off the car it was a bit of a distraction kept drawing my eye.', '2008-06-28 13:26:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4789141, 688820, 15291, '<td valign="top">Hi Chris,<br/>        I love the composition and the way you brought home the relationship between mom &amp; daughter, well done. I really like the image and just about everything about it, it just seems you got trapped out there in no mans land with a very harsh light &amp; basic editing left your hands tied.</td>', 'Hi Chris,        I love the composition and the way you brought home the relationship between mom & daughter, well done. I really like the image and just about everything about it, it just seems you got trapped out there in no mans land with a very harsh light & basic editing left your hands tied.', '2008-06-28 13:46:12.000000', NULL, 0),
